  ('Lady Moon', 'patreon', 'ladymoon', 'https://www.patreon.com/ladymoon/about', NULL, 'music', NULL, 'csv', 76, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. Creator first name Eva per page. MONETIZATION: 771 members (261 paid), sells song downloads, online music lessons and personal postcards. ACTIVITY: 255 posts. SOCIALS: Instagram @ladymooncries. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/ladymoon/about. FIT: lessons plus downloads plus physical mail - digital products, merch and messaging. OPENER: Lessons, downloads and postcards are three products living inside one tier list.', 'identified'),
