  ('Fancy Hat Productions', 'patreon', 'fancyhatproductions', 'https://www.patreon.com/fancyhatproductions', NULL, 'music', NULL, 'csv', 61, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. Creator name Eric McMyermick, performs as Eric McM per page. MONETIZATION: tiers from $5/month. CONTENT: music, audio engineering, writing, art; bands Caravan Discordia and Carrie Nation & the Speakeasy. FOLLOWERS: not published. Member count not shown. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/fancyhatproductions. FIT: multi-discipline independent musician. OPENER: Engineering, writing and performing under one banner needs a page that can hold all three.', 'identified'),
  ('The Closet Historian', 'patreon', 'theclosethistorian', 'https://www.patreon.com/theclosethistorian/about', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 82, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. Creator first name Bianca per page. MONETIZATION: 4,232 members (1,285 paid), page displays $6,958/month in pledges - by far the largest verified earner in this list. ACTIVITY: 354 posts. CONTENT: vintage fashion, pattern drafting, lookbooks. SOCIALS: Instagram @theclosethistorian, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/theclosethistorian/about. REVIEW FLAG: at ~$7k/month this creator is well established and may be harder to move - treat as a considered approach, not a cold pitch. OPENER: At this scale the platform cut is a salary - worth knowing what taking none of it looks like.', 'identified'),
  ('Gunnar Deatherage', 'patreon', 'gunnardeatherage', 'https://www.patreon.com/gunnardeatherage', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 75, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 14,571 members, tiers from $3/month. ACTIVITY: 302 posts. CONTENT: sewing patterns, fashion, DIY instruction. SOCIALS: Instagram and YouTube linked. FOLLOWERS: not published - the 14,571 figure is Patreon members, not social followers. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/gunnardeatherage. REVIEW FLAG: membership is above your 250k band on no metric, but the audience is large - confirm fit. FIT: sells patterns - a digital product business. OPENER: Patterns are a product, and products do better in a shop than behind a tier.', 'identified'),
  ('Gothbynight', 'patreon', 'gothbynight', 'https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 63, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching both the profile and the about page. MONETIZATION: 96 members but only 9 paid, tiers from $4/month - weak conversion against a large archive. ACTIVITY: 582 posts. CONTENT: artistic photography in gothic, fantasy, vintage and futuristic styles; indoor, outdoor and studio. Page renders in French. SOCIALS: Instagram @gothbynight. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCES: https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight ; https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight/about. FIT: photoset-led alternative aesthetic - paid posts. OPENER: Nearly 600 posts of work and nine people paying - the archive is worth more than the tiers make it.', 'identified'),
  ('DeLa Doll', 'other', 'deladoll', 'http://dela-doll.com/', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 66, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator''s own website. CONTENT: cosplay, makeup tutorials, blogging (media commentary, reviews, creator spotlights). MONETIZATION: own Shopify store at deladoll.myshopify.com plus a Kickstarter campaign for acrylic charms - already sells physical product and has run crowdfunding. ACTIVITY: latest post dated April 16 2026. LOCATION: not shown. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: business contact form at http://dela-doll.com/contact, which states "Please use this form to contact me with requests, business inquiries, general questions" - a legitimate published business contact method, but a form not an email, so the outreach flow cannot send to it. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: "Request Consultation" business enquiry form at https://scottlaidler.com/contact; the page also carries an email link protected by Cloudflare, so an address exists but is not retrievable. Legitimate business contact method, not an email. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: http://dela-doll.com/. FIT: writing plus cosplay plus a merch line across a blog, a Shopify store and Kickstarter - three services Spotlightly consolidates. REVIEW FLAG: no email found, needs a contact route before outreach. OPENER: A blog, a Shopify store and a Kickstarter is three platforms for one audience.', 'identified'),
  ('Scott Laidler', 'other', 'scottlaidlercoaching', 'https://scottlaidler.com/', NULL, 'fitness', 'United Kingdom', 'csv', 70, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach''s own website. MONETIZATION: online personal training at $235/month or $597/quarter - the highest-ticket offer verified in this list. CREDENTIALS stated on page: Psychology BSc, CIMSPA registered, 15 years experience, 10,000+ coaching hours. Also runs the Healthy Ambition Podcast. SOCIALS: Instagram @scottlaidlercoaching, YouTube, LinkedIn. Serves clients in the US, UK and 54 countries. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: "Request Consultation" business enquiry form at https://scottlaidler.com/contact; the page also carries an email link protected by Cloudflare, so an address exists but is not retrievable. Legitimate business contact method, not an email. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://scottlaidler.com/. REVIEW FLAG: trades under Health Forever LTD (Co. No. 10073449) - an individual coach operating through a limited company rather than a hobbyist. FIT: high-ticket coaching needs messaging and subscriptions more than paid posts. OPENER: At $235 a month your clients are buying access to you - that deserves better than email threads.', 'identified'),
  ('April Hunter', 'patreon', 'aprilhunter', 'https://www.patreon.com/aprilhunter', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 69, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $1/month; also sells candles, soap and bath bombs via Etsy shop AprilsScentSations. WEBSITE: AprilHunterBlog.com (stated on page, not separately fetched). CONTENT: essays, cosplay, pinup and fitness modelling, pro wrestling history. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/aprilhunter. FIT: writing plus modelling plus a physical product line - merch, subscriptions and paid posts. OPENER: The Etsy shop and the writing are the same brand living in two places.', 'identified'),
  ('FLASHnMODELS', 'patreon', 'FLASHnMODELS', 'https://www.patreon.com/FLASHnMODELS', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 57, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 28 paid members, tiers from $9/month. CONTENT: photoshoots, photography and editing. SOCIALS: Instagram @flashnmodels. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/FLASHnMODELS. REVIEW FLAG: photographer working with models rather than a self-branded model - check against your self-managed criterion. OPENER: Shoots and editing tutorials are separate products from the sets themselves.', 'identified'),
  ('TinyAngryCrafts', 'patreon', 'Tinyangrycrafts', 'https://www.patreon.com/Tinyangrycrafts', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 52, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 24 members, tiers from $1/month. ACTIVITY: 70 posts. CONTENT: clothing and video from various fashion eras. SOCIALS: Instagram, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/Tinyangrycrafts. REVIEW FLAG: early-stage monetisation. LOWER PRIORITY. OPENER: Historical clothing has a small, devoted audience - the kind that pays if you let them.', 'identified'),
  ('hoodied', 'patreon', 'hoodied', 'https://www.patreon.com/hoodied', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 50, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 110 members but only 1 paid - very weak conversion. TIERS: 1 through 5, from $1/month. CONTENT: handmade hoodies, sweaters and tunics inspired by comics and games; monthly patron-choice designs. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/hoodied. REVIEW FLAG: makes physical goods with almost no paid conversion - a merch storefront may suit better than memberships. LOWER PRIORITY. OPENER: Handmade clothing sells as a shop, not a subscription.', 'identified'),
  ('The Geeky Seamstress', 'other', 'thegeekyseamstress', 'https://thegeekyseamstress.com/costume-commissions/', 'thegeekyseamstress@gmail.com', 'cosplay', 'Texas, USA', 'csv', 86, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator''s own website. Creator first name Mindy per site. CONTACTABLE - email published in plain text by the creator on her own commissions page, for commission enquiries. MONETIZATION: costume commissions, Sailor Moon fuku from $500, Supers from $550, split payments over $250. Currently taking Sailor Moon commissions only, with a mailing list waitlist. ACTIVITY: latest blog post April 2025; 2025 contest wins including 1st Place Masters SoonerCon 2025; booked as cosplay guest, panellist and contest judge at Yellow City Comic Con and AggieCon. SOCIALS: Facebook, Twitter @geekyseamstress, Instagram @thegeekyseamstress, Tumblr, Pinterest. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCES: https://thegeekyseamstress.com/ ; https://thegeekyseamstress.com/costume-commissions/. FIT: highest-scoring prospect - self-managed, contactable, sells high-ticket commissions, runs a waitlist, and appears as a paid convention guest. Spotlightly would give her a commission queue, a wishlist and paid posts on one page. OPENER: You are running a commission waitlist off a mailing list and turning work away at $500 a costume - that queue deserves proper tooling.', 'identified'),
  ('Seme Cosplay', 'other', 'seme.cosplay', 'https://semecosplay.com/commissions/', 'info@semecosplay.com', 'cosplay', 'Berlin, Germany', 'csv', 81, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator''s own website. CONTACTABLE - business email published in plain text on the commissions page. MONETIZATION: full-costume commissions (wigs, armour, weapon replicas, jewellery, blueprints), payment plans, plus a pattern store on Etsy. SOCIALS: Instagram @seme.cosplay, YouTube SEMECosplay, WhatsApp, Linktree. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://semecosplay.com/commissions/. FIT: sells both commissions and digital patterns - Spotlightly covers commissions, digital products and tips in one place. REVIEW FLAG: EU-based, confirm Stripe Connect coverage. OPENER: Patterns on Etsy and commissions on your own site are two shops - they could be one page.', 'identified'),
  ('Christian R. P. Kurtis', 'other', 'kurtistattoo', 'https://www.kurtistattoo.com/', 'Inklingdesignstattoo@gmail.com', 'tattoo', 'Frederick, MD, USA', 'csv', 72, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the artist''s own website. CONTACTABLE - email published in plain text on his site for contact. NOTE: the address is the studio''s (Inkling Designs Tattoo) rather than personal, so treat outreach as reaching the studio. STYLE: blackwork, bold clean lines, dotwork, sacred geometry, henna style, fineline black and grey. LOCATION: Inkling Designs Tattoo, 16 East Patrick Street, 3rd Floor, Frederick MD - business address published on the site. SOCIALS: Instagram @kurtistattoo. FOLLOWERS: not published. MONETIZATION: tattooing itself; no memberships, tips or digital products found - weaker existing-monetisation signal than the Patreon cohort. SOURCE: https://www.kurtistattoo.com/. FIT: flash sales, deposits and a wishlist would be new revenue rather than a migration. OPENER: Flash sheets and deposits are the two things tattoo artists chase clients for - both work better on a page than in DMs.', 'identified'),
  ('TIFFY', 'other', 'tiffyallcaps', 'https://tiffy.bandcamp.com/', 'telltiffy@gmail.com', 'music', 'Somerville, MA, USA', 'csv', 85, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching BOTH the Bandcamp profile and the artist website tiffymusic.com. CONTACTABLE - booking/contact email published in plain text by the artist on her own Bandcamp profile and confirmed on her own site. MONETIZATION: music sales on Bandcamp plus merch - the I Wanted To Know EP cassette is on pre-order with bonus tracks. ACTIVITY: recent releases IRB featuring Sad13, Scam Likely, and The Sign. SOCIALS: Instagram @tiffyallcaps, Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, Bluesky, plus Spotify/Apple/Tidal/SoundCloud. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCES: https://tiffy.bandcamp.com/ ; https://tiffymusic.com/. FIT: self-releasing, sells physical merch, active release schedule, owns a domain - subscriptions, tips and merch all apply. OPENER: Pre-orders for a cassette run are exactly the moment a direct fan page earns its keep.', 'identified'),
  ('lost boy ?', 'other', 'lostboy', 'https://lostboy.bandcamp.com/', 'lofihigh@gmail.com', 'music', 'New York, NY, USA', 'csv', 78, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Bandcamp profile. CONTACTABLE - contact email published in plain text on the artist profile. MONETIZATION: music sales plus a separate merch store at papercupmusic.limitedrun.com. SOCIALS: SoundCloud, Twitter, Facebook, Instagram. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://lostboy.bandcamp.com/. FIT: already runs a standalone merch store alongside Bandcamp - two storefronts Spotlightly consolidates into one. OPENER: Running a limitedrun store next to Bandcamp is two shops for one audience.', 'identified'),
  ('CosPayton', 'other', 'cospayton', 'https://cospayton.com/pages/commissions', 'cospayton@gmail.com', 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 83, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator-owned website. CONTACTABLE - email published in plain text on the commissions page. MONETIZATION: unusually broad - sewing patterns, embroidered patches, prop blueprints and SVG files, 3D models and kits, custom fabric, plus scheduled commission windows (page states commissions last opened 1-5 June 2026). SOCIALS: Instagram @cospayton, YouTube @CosPayton, TikTok @cospayton, Twitter @cospayton. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://cospayton.com/pages/commissions. FIT: sells four distinct digital product lines plus commissions - the closest match found to Spotlightly digital products, merch and paid posts together. OPENER: Patterns, patches, blueprints and 3D kits are four product lines - they should not need four checkouts.', 'identified'),
  ('Crystal Wall Lancaster', 'other', 'pinupbombshells', 'https://www.pinupbombshells.com/', NULL, 'alternative fashion', 'Canada', 'csv', 62, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the artist-owned website. CONTENT: cartoon pinup illustration in the alternative/pinup space. MONETIZATION: commissioned artwork when schedule allows, plus merchandise (t-shirts, art prints, phone cases, pillows) through Threadless and Spreadshirt. SOCIALS: Facebook PinupBombshells, Instagram @pinupbombshells, Twitter @pinupbombshells. LOCATION: Canadian illustrator, city not stated. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.pinupbombshells.com/. REVIEW FLAG: an illustrator OF pinup art rather than a model - adjacent to your alternative-fashion niche rather than squarely inside it. FIT: print-on-demand merch through two third-party services, each taking a cut. OPENER: Threadless and Spreadshirt both take a margin on every print - a direct store does not.', 'identified'),
  ('Cosmell Cosplay', 'other', 'cosmellcosplay', 'https://www.cosmellcosplay.com/commissions', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 58, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CREATES: fursuits - heads, partial suits, fullbody suits and accessories. MONETIZATION: commission-based with scheduled windows (page states quotes and commissions open December/January 2026), plus an own shop and an Etsy store. SOCIALS: Instagram, Telegram, Bluesky, Twitter, YouTube, Facebook, Etsy, Trello. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.cosmellcosplay.com/commissions. REVIEW FLAG: fursuit making is costume craft but a distinct subculture from cosplay - decide whether it is in scope. FIT: commission queues and deposits. OPENER: Commission windows that open twice a year usually mean the queue is the bottleneck, not demand.', 'identified'),
  ('Sam Swanson', 'other', 'samswansonmusic', 'https://samswanson.bandcamp.com/', NULL, 'music', 'Winston Salem, NC, USA', 'csv', 56, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Bandcamp profile. MONETIZATION: music sales; the profile states Musician For Hire, indicating paid session or performance work. WEBSITE: samswansonmusic.com (stated on the profile, not separately fetched). EMAIL: not published on the Bandcamp profile. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://samswanson.bandcamp.com/. FIT: hire-for-work plus music sales - messaging and tips apply. REVIEW FLAG: no email found and no release date shown; verify cadence before prioritising. OPENER: Musician for hire is a booking enquiry waiting for somewhere to land.', 'identified'),
  ('Last Living Cannibal', 'other', 'lastlivingcannibal', 'https://lastlivingcannibal.bandcamp.com/', NULL, 'music', 'Hastings, United Kingdom', 'csv', 48, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Bandcamp profile. Described on the page as a solo project, self-released. MONETIZATION: album and track sales on Bandcamp. SOCIALS: none shown. EMAIL: not published. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://lastlivingcannibal.bandcamp.com/. REVIEW FLAG: no socials, no email and no release date visible - the thinnest profile in the music cohort. LOW PRIORITY. OPENER: Self-releasing means you already kept control - the next step is keeping the margin.', 'identified'),
  ('scooterbabe', 'other', 'scooterbabemusic', 'https://scooterbabe.bandcamp.com/', NULL, 'music', 'Athens, GA, USA', 'csv', 54, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Bandcamp profile. CONTACT: an address IS published by the artist, but deliberately obfuscated on the page as scooterbabemusic (at) gmail.com. Recorded here exactly as displayed and left OUT of the email column, because de-obfuscating it would be inferring an address rather than reading one - a human can convert it in one step before any outreach. MONETIZATION: cassette releases on Bandcamp. SOCIALS: Facebook facebook.com/scooterbabemusic. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://scooterbabe.bandcamp.com/. REVIEW FLAG: no recent release date shown - confirm the project is still active before contacting. OPENER: Cassette runs sell to the people who already care - reaching them directly is the whole game.', 'identified'),
  ('Dear Darkness', 'other', 'deardarknessdetroit', 'https://deardarkness1.bandcamp.com/', NULL, 'music', 'Detroit, MI, USA', 'csv', 64, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Bandcamp profile. MONETIZATION: digital album from $5 and cassette-plus-digital from $10 - already sells physical product direct to fans. ACTIVITY: latest release 9 December 2025. SOCIALS: Instagram instagram.com/deardarknessdetroit, Facebook, SoundCloud. EMAIL: not published on the profile. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://deardarkness1.bandcamp.com/. FIT: cassette runs and direct digital sales are exactly the audience that pays directly - tips, subscriptions and merch all apply. REVIEW FLAG: no email published; Instagram DM is the available route. OPENER: Cassette runs sell to people who want the object, not the stream - they are the ones worth having a direct line to.', 'identified')
